      "new_line": "- [ ] **M6.B5L.ALL** Eleven of sixteen rooted types remain closed. The five open rooted types are house roof/hub/lower and fan endpoint/inner, with exactly six original S families in six load orbits: roof ABC, hub TC/TCB, lower TDC, fan endpoint234 and inner134. The entire roof AC.S family is now excluded by the general uniform hub-exit support theorem. Every original D alternative remains excluded, as do lower TD.S and TAC.S. Each surviving rooted parent retains all three arbitrary completion squares, original true degrees, full forces, masks and means. C1.5.b1 remains open.",
